Hi all,

Could we plan a 2.9.2 release by the end of the month? It's three months
ago since the previous release already. The list of changes isn't very
long, but there are a few things people could be interested in: a new
driver (i2c-ali2563), Linux 2.6 support for decode-dimms.pl and rrd, and
a few improvements to sensors-detect which may help our support work.

